<title>UK: SOCCER-CREWE WIN PROMOTION TO ENGLISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CREWE WIN PROMOTION TO ENGLISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crewe won a place in next season's English first division when they beat Brentford 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in the second division promotion play-off final at Wembley on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Shaun Smith 34</p>
<p>Attendance: 34,149</p>
